  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding to support the International Committee of the Red Cross ICRC&#x2019;s appeal in Israel and the occupied territories.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ICRC has been providing assistance to people affected by the conflict and violence in Israel and the Occupied Territories (ILOT) since 1967. In Israel and the occupied territories, the ICRC strives to make a difference in people&apos;s lives through its activities and programmes.</narrative>
  </description>
